# shadcn/ui look (Upside Lab)

Black field. Glass cards. Comfortable density (`gap-6` / `p-6`). One accent: `--primary` is a **subtle warm yellow**, `oklch(0.8 0.09 90)` — muted and low-chroma on purpose, not near-white and not a bright brand gold. Compose primitives. Do not restyle a component with extra colors.

## Tokens

`bg-background` is true black. Top-level cards are the `.glass` utility (translucent `bg-card` + backdrop blur) with `ring-1 ring-foreground/20` — an opaque `bg-card` here blocks the ambient corner glow, which is the whole point of the material. Nested wells are `.glass-well rounded-lg`, never a card in a card.

Use `BOX` / `CARD` / `SCORE_CELL` / `LIST` from `Panel.tsx` rather than assembling those class strings by hand.

Money up/down is `text-gain` / `text-loss`. Not a wash. (`text-destructive` is for destructive *actions* — delete buttons, error alerts — not for a number that went down.)

## Density

- Page titles: `text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em]`. Panel titles: `text-lg tracking-[-0.028em]`. Heading tracking is a scale, not a constant — bigger type needs more of it. Body and labels: `text-sm`. Chart ticks, Badge, and kbd stay `text-xs`.
- Headings and the wordmark are **Archivo** (`--font-heading` / `--font-logo`). Geist for every sentence, Geist Mono for every figure.
- Labels over a figure, and every table header, are mono caps: `font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-muted-foreground` (`MicroLabel`). Caps are that voice plus the logo, nothing else.
- Scoreboard figures: `text-2xl`. Each Score is its own card with `gap-4` between cards, not a hairline bar.
- Controls are `h-8` / `rounded-lg` (`sm` is `h-7`, `lg` is `h-9`). Only the signed-out landing CTA is `h-11 rounded-full`.
- Page gutter is `px-6`. Panel pad is `p-6`. Drawers and overlays use the same pad.

## Primitives

Button (variants, no `btn-primary`). Input / Field / FieldGroup. Card header/content/footer. AlertDialog for confirm. Empty for empty. ToggleGroup for 2–7 choices. Badge not custom chips. Avatar with Fallback. Sonner toasts.

`gap-*` not `space-y-*`. `size-8` not `h-8 w-8`. `cn()` for conditionals. Icons in buttons: `data-icon`, no extra size class.
